# =============================================================================
# Transmission VPN Shield - RPC credentials (secret)
# =============================================================================
# This file is kept chmod 600 (root only) so the world-readable guard.conf
# never has to hold the RPC password.
#
# Fill these in ONLY if Transmission has "Enable authentication" checked in
# its Remote Access settings. Leave empty otherwise.
#
# After editing, restart the package from DSM Package Center
# (or: sudo synopkg restart transmission-vpn-shield).
# =============================================================================

RPC_USER=""
RPC_PASS=""
